TITLE 1D transport, 10 cells, 10 shifts, exchange 0.001 mol sites, equilibrate 1

SOLUTION 0 Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -print_cells 10
    -punch_cells 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true

USER_PUNCH
    -headings tr shift sol pe
10 PUNCH TRANSPORT, SHIFT, SOLN, -LA("e-")

END
